---
# FILE: maintenance-status.json
# PURPOSE: Tiny file reporting the site's current maintenance-mode state
# (the `enabled` value in _data/maintenance.yml, editable from the CMS),
# fetched fresh (cache: 'no-store' + a timestamp query string) by the
# script in _includes/head.html on every page load. Exists specifically
# so that check is immune to a visitor's browser (or GitHub's CDN)
# serving a stale cached copy of the surrounding page's own HTML -- see
# head.html's comment for the full explanation.
layout: null
---
{"maintenance": {{ site.data.maintenance.enabled | default: false | jsonify }}}
